<td><div style="color:#464646"><ul id="plainSister" style="display:inline-block; font-size:93%; line-height:normal; list-style-type:none; list-style-image:none; list-style-position:outside; border:1px solid var(--border-color-base,#AAA); float:right; clear:right; margin:0.5ex 0.5ex 0.5ex 0.5ex; padding:0.0ex 0.0ex 0.0ex 0.0ex; background-color:var(--background-color-base,#FFFFFF);color: inherit;"><li class="noprint sisitem"><span class="sisicon" style="padding-right:1ex;"><span typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="/wiki/Special:SiteMatrix" title="Special:SiteMatrix"><img alt="姊妹计划" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wikimedia-logo.svg/20px-Wikimedia-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wikimedia-logo.svg/40px-Wikimedia-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="1024" data-file-height="1024" /></a></span></span><a href="/wiki/Special:SiteMatrix" title="Special:SiteMatrix">姊妹计划</a>: <a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q85432081" class="extiw" title="d:Q85432081">数据项</a></li></ul> </div>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" />
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="獻書秦王"><span id=".E7.8D.BB.E6.9B.B8.E7.A7.A6.E7.8E.8B"></span>獻書秦王</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="编辑章节：獻書秦王"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p><small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>闕文<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>獻書秦王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本昭。正曰：無考。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>曰：「昔竊聞大王之謀出事於梁，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「昔」作「臣」。○　謂攻之。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>謀恐不出於計矣，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本非得計也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>願大王之熟計之也。梁者，山東之要<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本腰。人身之中。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>也。有蛇於此，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本兵法所謂「率然」。補曰：見孫武書及李靖問答。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>擊其尾，其首救；擊其首，其尾救；擊其中身，首尾皆救。今梁王，天下之中身也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「皆」作「俱」，「王」作「者」，「中身」作「脊」。○　補曰：一本「今梁王，天下之中身也」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「秦」上有「夫」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>攻梁者，是示天下要斷山東之脊也，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本要，猶欲。正曰：要，同上義。「山東脊」、「天下要」，與上互言之。示者，顯取之之意。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>是山東首尾皆救中身之時也。山東見亡必恐，恐必大合，山東尚強，臣見秦之必大憂可立而待也。臣竊為大王計，不如南出。事於南方，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本謂楚。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>其兵弱，天下必能救，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「必」上補「不」字。○　補曰：作「必不」語順。又「必」字，恐當作「不」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>地可廣大，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本曾無「大」字。　鮑本言秦地。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>國可富，兵可強，主可尊。王不聞湯之伐桀乎？試之弱密須氏<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本試，謂先之以其弱，可必克也。周紀註，密須在安定陰密。補曰：密，姞姓國，在今寧州。史周紀「西伯伐密須」，詩所謂「密人不恭」者也。此誤以為湯，又云「試之於弱」。戰國游士言聖賢事多妄謬，此尤顯然者也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>以為武教，得密須氏而湯之<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「之」作「知」。○　札記丕烈案：「知」字當是。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>服桀矣。今秦國<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「國」作「欲」。○　札記丕烈案：「欲」字當是。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>與山東為讎，不先以弱為武教，兵必大挫，國必大憂。」秦果南攻藍田、鄢、郢。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本藍田，秦地，疑衍文。彪謂：征伐先後，理正應爾。故司馬為秦議，以伐蜀為先。而我藝祖欲平太原諸國，亦先平蜀。正曰：秦之攻楚，多道藍田、武關以出攻，如敗楚藍田之云。秦人善遠交近攻之策，蠶食諸侯，先三晉而後齊、楚，卒以成功，其用兵之序可考矣。此策，魏畏秦攻，移禍於楚，故飾為之辭。而鮑謂「征伐先後，理正應爾」，夫豈識當時大勢哉！又以司馬錯先伐蜀，宋欲平太原，亦先平蜀，為試於弱之徵，謬矣。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="八年謂魏王"><span id=".E5.85.AB.E5.B9.B4.E8.AC.82.E9.AD.8F.E7.8E.8B"></span>八年謂魏王</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2" title="编辑章节：八年謂魏王"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>八年，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「八」上補「十」字。○　此八年，春申未到。正曰：追稱之辭。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small><b><small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>闕文<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small></b>謂魏王曰：「昔曹<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本曹，今定陶。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>恃齊而輕晉，齊伐釐、莒<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本釐，疑扶風漦。正曰：此不相涉。齊策，「昔者萊、莒好謀，陳、蔡好詐，莒恃越而滅，蔡恃晉而亡」。此「釐」字即「萊」。左傳，「公會鄭伯於郲」，杜註，「釐城」。劉向引「來牟」作「釐牟」。古字通。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>而晉人亡曹。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本史，曹伯陽十五年背晉，宋滅之。哀公八年。正曰：即僖二十八年晉侯伐曹，分曹、衛田事。凡言亡，非必國滅也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>繒恃齊以悍越，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「以悍」作「而輕」。○　繒，禹後，屬東海。補曰：姚本「恃齊以捍越」。春秋「鄫」，穀梁作「繒」。杜註，「今琅邪鄫縣」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>齊和子<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本太公田和。正曰：恐非。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>亂而越人亡繒。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本哀六年，莒人滅鄫，與此異。補曰：左氏，「莒人滅鄫，鄫恃賂也」。註，「鄫有貢賦之賂在魯，恃之而慢莒」。此或訛為「齊」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>鄭恃魏以輕韓，伐<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「伐」上補「魏」字。○　補曰：此宜有「魏」字。　札記今本「伐」上有「魏」字，乃誤涉鮑也。丕烈案：此因即說本國事，故不更云「魏」，取便文也，補者非是。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>榆關<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本九域圖，在平州界。正曰：大事記，安王三年，楚歸鄭榆關。十一年，魏、韓、趙敗楚師于大梁榆關。正義云，榆關在鄭之南，大梁西。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>而韓氏亡鄭。原恃秦、翟以輕晉，秦、翟年穀大凶而晉人亡原。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本僖二十五年，原降，使趙衰處原。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>中山恃齊、魏以輕趙，齊、魏伐楚而趙亡中山。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：周策，宮他謂周君曰云云，略同。　齊、魏伐楚而趙亡中山，此襄王十八年秦、韓、魏、齊共敗楚將唐昧事。大事記謂史稱趙與燕、齊滅中山，齊非中山與國者，亦未然，說見燕、趙等策。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>此五國所以亡者，皆其<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「其」作「有」。○　札記今本「其」作「有」，乃誤涉鮑也。丕烈案：其者，其五國也。鮑改誤甚。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>所恃也。非獨此五國為然而已也，天下之亡國皆然矣。夫國之所以不可恃者多，其變不可勝數也。或以政教不脩，上下不輯，而不可恃者；或有諸侯鄰國之虞，而不可恃者；或以年穀不登，稸<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「稸」作「畜」。○　補曰：一本「畜」作「稸」，此書多作「稸」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>積竭盡，而不可恃者；或化<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本化，猶移。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>於利，比<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本比，猶近。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>於患。臣以此知國之不可必恃也。今王恃楚之強，而信春申君之言，以是質<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「質」作「賓」。○　補曰：未詳。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦，而久<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本久，猶後。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>不可知。即春申君有變，是王獨受秦患也。即<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本即，猶是。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>王有萬乘之國，而以一人之心為命也。臣以此為不完，願王之熟計之也。」
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="魏王問張旄"><span id=".E9.AD.8F.E7.8E.8B.E5.95.8F.E5.BC.B5.E6.97.84"></span>魏王問張旄</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="编辑章节：魏王問張旄"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>魏王問張旄曰：「吾欲與秦攻韓，何如？」張旄對曰：「韓且坐而胥<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「胥」作「咠」。○　「咠」，「胥」同，待也。補曰：一本「咠」作「𦙃」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>亡乎？且割而從天下乎？」王曰：「韓且割而從天下。」張旄曰：「韓怨魏乎？怨秦乎？」王曰：「怨魏。」張旄曰：「韓強秦乎？強魏乎？」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本問以何國為強。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>王曰：「強秦。」張旄曰：「韓且割而從其所強，與所不怨乎？且割而從其所不強，與其所怨乎？」王曰：「韓將割而從其所強，與其所不怨。」張旄曰：「攻韓之事，王自知矣。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：此恐與信陵所諫同一事。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="客謂司馬食其"><span id=".E5.AE.A2.E8.AC.82.E5.8F.B8.E9.A6.AC.E9.A3.9F.E5.85.B6"></span>客謂司馬食其</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="编辑章节：客謂司馬食其"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>客謂司馬食其<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本魏人，音異基。補曰：索隱云，酈、審、趙三人，並以六國時魏有司馬食其，慕其名也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>曰：「慮久<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本劉無「久」字。　鮑本慮久，熟慮也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>以天下為可一者，是不知天下者也。欲獨以魏支秦者，是又不知魏者也。謂茲公<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本指合從之人。補曰：「茲公」未詳。史，夏侯嬰食茲氏，注，太原縣名。春秋昭五年注「莒邑」者，又地不相涉。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>不知此兩者，又不知茲公者也。然而茲公為從，其說何也？從則茲公重，不從則茲公輕，茲公之處重也，不<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一本添「以」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>實為期。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本言期約不實。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>子何不疾及三國方堅也，自賣於秦，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本謂陰倍從，以收秦利。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦必受子。不然，橫者將圖子以合於秦，是取子之資，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本資，謂從。食其所資者，從也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>而以資子之讎也。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本謂橫人將以食其之從惡之於秦。讎，秦也。正曰：時與人不可考。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="魏秦伐楚"><span id=".E9.AD.8F.E7.A7.A6.E4.BC.90.E6.A5.9A"></span>魏秦伐楚</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="编辑章节：魏秦伐楚"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>魏、秦<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本劉作「秦、魏」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>伐楚，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本秦昭六年與韓、魏共攻楚，此十八年。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>魏王不欲。樓緩謂魏王曰：「王不與秦攻楚，楚且與秦攻王。王不如令秦、楚戰，王交制之<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本緩時為秦計耳，故明年相秦。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>也。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本無「也」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="穰侯攻大梁"><span id=".E7.A9.B0.E4.BE.AF.E6.94.BB.E5.A4.A7.E6.A2.81"></span>穰侯攻大梁</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6" title="编辑章节：穰侯攻大梁"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>穰侯攻大梁，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本秦昭二十四年，攻魏至大梁，此十三年。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>乘北郢，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「北郢」作「郢北」。○　郢，楚別邑，其北近魏。正曰：北郢乃楚之宜城，即郡也。史魏冉傳，「入北宅，遂圍大梁」。此訛為「乘北郢」也。又策作「入北地」，亦字訛。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>魏王且從。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本從，順服也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>謂穰侯曰：「君攻楚得宛、穰以廣陶，攻齊得剛、博<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本並屬泰山。補曰：正義引括地志云，故剛城在兗州龔丘縣界。愚謂，剛博當即是剛壽。正義云，壽，鄆州縣。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>以廣陶，得許、<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：「得許」上當有「攻魏」字，缺脫。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>鄢陵以廣陶，秦王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本昭。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>不問者，何也？以大梁之未亡也。今日大梁亡，許、鄢陵必議，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本議其不當得。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>議則君必窮。為君計者，勿攻便。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：魏昭王十三年秦兵至大梁，即取魏安城之役。安釐王二年，秦魏冉伐魏，走芒卯，入北宅，遂圍大梁，魏割溫以和。二役皆冉相時，而敗芒卯則冉將以伐。此策當在其時。大事記載須賈說穰侯云云，「攻而不拔，秦兵必罷，陶邑必亡，前功必棄矣」，下註此章，謂與須賈同一術，亦以為此年事矣。然秦攻取剛壽，在秦昭三十六、七年，後此數年。而策已云得剛壽，而又不可曉也。當考。　宛、穰廣陶，說見趙策。　許、鄢陵，魏地，見前。秦得其地，不知何時。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="白珪謂新城君"><span id=".E7.99.BD.E7.8F.AA.E8.AC.82.E6.96.B0.E5.9F.8E.E5.90.9B"></span>白珪謂新城君</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7" title="编辑章节：白珪謂新城君"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>白珪<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本劉作「圭」。　鮑本魏人，孟子稱之。趙岐以為周人，非也。蓋至是三、四十年矣。正曰：秦昭王初年，魏冉已用事，則羋戎之貴已久。十二年而當魏昭元年，則其初年猶與魏襄相及，正孟子時也。趙岐以為周人，何以知其非也？但戰國人姓名多偶同者。鮑以在魏策中而即為魏人，謬矣。又按燕策，白珪逃於秦，則嘗仕秦。新序孟嘗君問白珪，恐亦此時。史白珪傳首云，當魏文侯時，李克務盡地力，而白珪樂觀時變。後復引圭之言曰，「吾治生產，如孫、吳用兵，商鞅行法」，則其人在鞅後。首句特與李克對論，非言其世也。以「二十取一」語，孟子正欲以其貨殖之術施之國家者也。又新序記白珪戰，亡六城，為魏取中山，白珪顯於中山，中山人惡之於魏文侯，投以夜光之壁。則文侯時又一白珪歟？或因史所書而訛舛歟？<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>謂新城君曰：「夜行者能無<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本劉作「不」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>為姦，不能禁狗使無吠己也。故臣能無議君於王，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本戎貴於秦。王，宜為秦王。今珪說之，豈非珪使魏，戎來魏。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>不能禁人議臣<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本無「臣」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>於君也。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本秦策段產語同。正曰：段產，策本在韓，鮑以史註新城君為羋戎，故曲為之說，未知即是此人否？<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="秦攻韓之管"><span id=".E7.A7.A6.E6.94.BB.E9.9F.93.E4.B9.8B.E7.AE.A1"></span>秦攻韓之管</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8" title="编辑章节：秦攻韓之管"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>秦攻韓之管，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本後志河南管城註，在京縣東北。補曰：鄭州管城縣。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>魏王發兵救之。昭忌曰：「夫秦強國也，而韓、魏壤梁，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本劉作「秦」。　鮑本「梁」作「秦」。○　言地與秦接。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>不出攻則已，若出攻，非於韓也必<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「必」下有「於」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>魏也。今幸而<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本曾添「歸」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>於韓，此魏之福也。王若救之，夫解攻者，必韓之管也；致攻者，必魏之梁也。」魏王不聽，曰：「若不因<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本劉無「因」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>救韓，韓怨魏，西合於秦，秦、韓為一，則魏危。」遂救之。
</p><p>秦果釋管而攻魏。魏王大恐，謂昭忌曰：「不用子之計而禍至，為之奈何？」昭忌乃為之見秦王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本昭。正曰：時不可考。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>曰：「臣聞明主之聽也，不以挾私為政，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本與「正」同。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>是參行<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本以諸國參考而行，言參彼己也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>也。願大王無攻魏，聽臣也。」秦王曰：「何也？」昭忌曰：「山東之從，時合時離，何也哉？」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本無「哉」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦王曰：「不識也。」曰：「天下之合也，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本無「也」字。○　補曰：一本此下有「也」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>以王之不必<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本猶言不可測也，方攻韓又攻魏是也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>也；其離也，以王之必也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本伐一不移伐，則諸國知免，不急於從也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>今攻韓之管，國危矣，未卒而移兵於梁，合天下之從，無精<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本精，猶明。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>於此者矣。以為秦之求索，必不可支也。故為王計者，不如齊<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「齊」作「制」。○　補曰：疑字誤，或上有缺文。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>趙。秦已制趙，則燕不敢不事秦，荊、齊<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「齊」作「濟」。○　荊，楚；濟，齊。正曰：一本「荊、齊」，是。未有稱「齊」為「濟」者，字多傍水。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>不能獨從。天下爭敵於秦，則弱矣。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本言諸國合而競與秦敵，則秦弱。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦王乃止。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本彪謂：鄰國有兵，救之，卹鄰之義，昭王言是也。秦伐韓而魏救之，挑秦之禍，昭忌之言亦是也。要之，從約堅則宜救，猶救同室之鬬也。無從約而救之，則是鄉鄰有鬬，被髮纓冠而往，是豈不可已乎？<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="秦趙構難而戰"><span id=".E7.A7.A6.E8.B6.99.E6.A7.8B.E9.9B.A3.E8.80.8C.E6.88.B0"></span>秦趙構難而戰</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9" title="编辑章节：秦趙構難而戰"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>秦、趙構難而戰。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本長平之役。此十七年。正曰：秦、趙之戰多矣，此策時不可考。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>謂魏王曰：「不如齊、<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「齊」作「收」。○　正曰：「齊」上有脫字，下文言齊可推。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>趙而構之秦。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本構者，合其戰也。收趙而助之，趙必與秦合戰。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>王不構趙，趙不以毀構矣；<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本毀，折也。言不收趙，趙不能以毀折之兵獨與秦合戰。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>而構之秦，趙必復鬬，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「鬬」下復有「鬬」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>必重魏；是并制秦、趙之事也。王欲<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本欲，意或欲也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>焉而收齊、趙攻荊，欲焉而收荊、趙攻齊，欲王之東長<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本荊、齊在魏東，不樂屬秦，而欲魏為之長。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>之待<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本曾作「侍」。　鮑本「待」上有「也」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>之也。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本待魏之東。正曰：荊、齊、趙皆在魏東。長之，為之長也。待之，待其事也。欲王者，此士願之之辭，與上「王欲焉」不同也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="長平之役"><span id=".E9.95.B7.E5.B9.B3.E4.B9.8B.E5.BD.B9"></span>長平之役</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10" title="编辑章节：長平之役"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>長平之役，平都君<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本田單。正曰：注非，說見趙策。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>說魏王曰：「王胡不為從？」魏王曰：「秦許吾以垣雍。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本韓所得魏地。補曰：垣雍見前。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>平都君曰：「臣以垣雍為空割也。」魏王曰：「何謂也？」平都君曰：「秦、趙久相持於長平之下而無<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一本添「大」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>決。天下合於秦，則無趙；合於趙，則無秦。秦恐王之變也，故以垣雍餌王也。秦戰勝趙，王敢責垣雍之割乎？王曰『不敢』。秦戰不勝趙，王能令韓出垣雍之割乎？<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本韓不畏秦故。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>王曰『不能』。臣故曰，垣雍空割也。」魏王曰：「善。」
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="樓梧約秦魏"><span id=".E6.A8.93.E6.A2.A7.E7.B4.84.E7.A7.A6.E9.AD.8F"></span>樓梧約秦魏</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11" title="编辑章节：樓梧約秦魏"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>樓梧約秦、魏，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一作「郚」。　鮑本補曰：前有樓牾約秦、魏，即此人此時事也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>將令秦王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本昭。正曰：無據。「將令」之「令」，平聲。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>遇於境。謂魏王曰：<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本或謂非梧。正曰：未見非梧。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>「遇而無相，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本無相魏者。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦必置相。不聽之，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一本無「之」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>則交惡於秦；聽之，則後王之臣，將皆務事諸侯之能令於王之上者。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「王」下無「之」字。○　言處魏上，而能使之從令若秦者。補曰：一本「王之上者」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>且遇於秦而相秦者，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本相，秦所置。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>是無齊也，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本獨言齊者，時君王后賢，與齊敵也。正曰：註謬甚。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦必輕王之強矣。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本無齊助故。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>有齊者，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本群臣能得齊事者。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>不<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「不」上有「王」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>若相之，齊必喜，是以有雍者<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「雍」作「齊」。○　札記今本「雍」作「齊」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>與秦遇，秦必重王矣。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：此時必魏合於齊。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="芮宋欲絕秦趙之交"><span id=".E8.8A.AE.E5.AE.8B.E6.AC.B2.E7.B5.95.E7.A7.A6.E8.B6.99.E4.B9.8B.E4.BA.A4"></span>芮宋欲絕秦趙之交</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12" title="编辑章节：芮宋欲絕秦趙之交"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>芮宋<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本魏人。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>欲絕秦、趙之交，故令魏氏收秦太后<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本宣太后。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>之養地秦王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本昭。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>於秦。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「於秦」二字作「怒」。○　補曰：姚本「收秦太后之養地秦王於秦，芮宋」云云，與此文有誤，當云「收秦太后之養地於秦，芮宋謂」云云。　札記今本「於秦」二字作「怒」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>芮宋謂秦王曰：「魏委<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本委，與之。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>國於王，而王不受，故委國於趙也。李郝<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本趙人。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>謂臣曰：『子言無秦，而養秦太后以地，是欺我也，故敝邑收之。』」秦王怒，遂絕趙也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本無「也」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="為魏謂楚王[1]"><span id=".E7.82.BA.E9.AD.8F.E8.AC.82.E6.A5.9A.E7.8E.8B.5B1.5D"></span>為魏謂楚王<sup id="cite&#95;ref-1" class="reference"><a href="#cite_note-1"><span class="cite-bracket">&#91;</span>1<span class="cite-bracket">&#93;</span></a></sup></h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13" title="编辑章节：為魏謂楚王[1]"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>為魏謂楚王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本頃襄。正曰：無考。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>曰：「索攻魏於秦，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本楚以攻魏索於秦。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦必不聽王矣，是智困於秦，而交疏於魏也。楚、魏有怨，則秦重矣。故王不如順天下，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本天下不欲秦伐魏。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>遂伐齊，與魏便地，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本言以所得齊地與魏，易兩便也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>兵不傷，交不變，所欲必得矣。」
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="管鼻之令翟強與秦事"><span id=".E7.AE.A1.E9.BC.BB.E4.B9.8B.E4.BB.A4.E7.BF.9F.E5.BC.B7.E8.88.87.E7.A7.A6.E4.BA.8B"></span>管鼻之令翟強與秦事</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14" title="编辑章节：管鼻之令翟強與秦事"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>管鼻之<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本魏人。正曰：註作「鼻之」名，謬。下兩「之」字亦語助。管鼻恐即樓鼻，說見前。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>令翟強與秦事，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本鼻之不欲，故推之於強。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>謂<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本鼻之謂之。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>魏王曰：「鼻之與強，猶晉人之與楚人也。晉人見楚人之急，帶劍而緩之；楚人惡其緩而急之。令<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「令」作「今」。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>鼻之入秦之傳舍，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本酈食其傳註，「止息傳置之舍」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>舍不足以舍之。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本侍衛之盛，舍不能容。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>強之入，無蔽於秦者。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「蔽」作「蘇」。○　言秦輕之，無與為樵蘇者。正曰：一本「蘇」作「蔽」，是。言無人從之。札記丕烈案：史記刺客傳「跪而蔽席」，索隱曰，「蔽，匹結反，猶拂也」。此字與彼同。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>強，王貴臣也，而秦若此其甚，安可？」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本秦待己已厚，可以不與秦事。秦輕強矣，欲其重之，必令與秦事乃可。正曰：翟強欲合齊、秦外楚，以輕樓鼻；樓鼻欲合秦、楚外齊，以輕翟強。鼻、強不合，而謂鼻令強與秦事者，鼻容強為之。秦入鼻言，故輕強。此士蓋為強言，以激魏王者也。此當在襄王時。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="成陽君欲以韓魏聽秦"><span id=".E6.88.90.E9.99.BD.E5.90.9B.E6.AC.B2.E4.BB.A5.E9.9F.93.E9.AD.8F.E8.81.BD.E7.A7.A6"></span>成陽君欲以韓魏聽秦</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15" title="编辑章节：成陽君欲以韓魏聽秦"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>成陽君<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本秦昭十七年入朝者，於此知為韓人不疑。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>欲以韓、魏聽秦，魏王弗利。白圭謂魏王曰：「王不如陰侯<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一作「使」。　鮑本「圭」作「珪」，「侯」作「使」。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>人說成陽君曰：『君入秦，秦必留君，而以多割於韓矣。韓不聽，秦必留君，而伐韓矣。故君不如安<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本安，猶徐。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>行求質<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本質，事。有不留之驗，乃可入。正曰：「質子」之「質」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>於秦。』成陽君必不入秦，秦、韓不敢<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本衍「敢」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>合，則王重矣。」
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="秦拔寧邑"><span id=".E7.A7.A6.E6.8B.94.E5.AF.A7.E9.82.91"></span>秦拔寧邑</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16" title="编辑章节：秦拔寧邑"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>秦拔寧邑，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本此二十年。正曰：秦昭王四十一年，魏冉已免相。此十一年。餘說見趙策。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>魏王令之<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「之」作「人」。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>謂秦王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本昭。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>曰：「王歸寧邑，吾謂先天下構。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「構」作「搆」，又改作「講」。○　下同。謂與秦講。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>魏<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本衍「魏」字。補曰：衍。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>魏王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「王」作「冉」。○　札記丕烈案：「冉」字當是。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>曰：「王無聽。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本無聽其講。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>魏王見天下之不足恃也，故欲先構。夫亡寧者，宜割二寧以求構；夫得寧者，安能歸寧乎？」
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="秦罷邯鄲"><span id=".E7.A7.A6.E7.BD.B7.E9.82.AF.E9.84.B2"></span>秦罷邯鄲</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17" title="编辑章节：秦罷邯鄲"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>秦罷邯鄲，攻魏，取寧邑。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本正曰：邯鄲，趙都。凡攻趙皆言邯鄲。此策罷邯鄲，必非赧王五十八年解邯鄲圍時事。且秦紀書拔寧、新中。次年，赧王五十九年。年表，韓、魏、楚救趙新中，而秦兵罷，不聞卒拔也。是歲赧王入秦，而此云過二周攻王，是二周無恙時也，決為在前無疑。寧、新中，非寧邑，詳見趙策。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>吳慶<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本吳人。正曰：無考。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>恐魏王之構<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「構」作「搆」，又改作「講」。○　原從扌從冓。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>於秦也，謂魏王曰：「秦之<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本曾無「之」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>攻王也，王知其故乎？天下皆曰王近也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本近，親也。天下以魏為親秦，故外之，秦因攻之。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>王不近秦，秦之所去。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本去，猶遠。正曰：王非親秦，乃秦之所欲攻去者。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>皆曰王弱也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本無秦之助。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>王不弱二周，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本言實不弱，視二周猶強也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦人去邯鄲，過二周而攻王者，以王為易制也。王亦知弱之召攻乎？」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本若講於秦，復示弱也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="魏王欲攻邯鄲"><span id=".E9.AD.8F.E7.8E.8B.E6.AC.B2.E6.94.BB.E9.82.AF.E9.84.B2"></span>魏王欲攻邯鄲</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=18" title="编辑章节：魏王欲攻邯鄲"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>魏王欲攻邯鄲，季梁<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本魏人，非莊子所稱。正曰：不可考，亦不知何時。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>聞之，中道而反，衣焦不申，頭塵不去，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本此於行路，犯風日，故焦；焦故不申。需潤乃申耳。皆以欲見之速，故不暇。補曰：焦，卷也。申，舒也。文選「申」作「信」，「去」作「浴」。　札記丕烈案：此詠懷詩注也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>往見王曰：「今者<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>札記今本「者」誤「之」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>臣來，見人於大行，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：行，道也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>方北面而持其駕，告臣曰：『我欲之楚。』臣曰：『君之楚，將奚為北面？』曰：『吾馬良。』臣曰：『馬雖良，此非楚之路也。』曰：『吾用<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本用，資也。　鮑本用，所資也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>多。』臣曰：『用雖多，此非楚之路也。』曰：『吾御者善。』『此數者愈善，而離楚愈遠耳。』今王動欲成霸王，舉欲信於天下。恃王國之大，兵之精銳，而攻邯鄲，以廣地尊名，王之動愈數，而離王愈遠耳。猶至楚而北行也。」
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="周肖謂宮他"><span id=".E5.91.A8.E8.82.96.E8.AC.82.E5.AE.AE.E4.BB.96"></span>周肖謂宮他</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=19" title="编辑章节：周肖謂宮他"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>周肖<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本疑即霄。正曰：孟子註，魏人。若以為此人，則非安釐之世矣。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>謂宮他曰：「子為肖謂齊王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本王庭。正曰：無據，事必在前。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>曰，肖願為外臣。令齊資我於魏。」宮他曰：「不可，是示齊輕也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本肖，魏臣，而假重於外，是示齊以無魏之重。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>夫齊不以無魏者以害有魏者，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本所不重，為無肖是也。正曰：齊必不以無魏重者而害有魏重者，不可示以無魏重也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>故公不如示有魏。公曰：<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本令肖以此說齊。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>『王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本齊。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>之所求於魏者，臣請以魏聽。』齊必資公矣，是公有齊，以齊有魏也。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本因齊之資以得魏重。「肖」，當作「霄」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="周冣善齊"><span id=".E5.91.A8.E5.86.A3.E5.96.84.E9.BD.8A"></span>周冣善齊</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20" title="编辑章节：周冣善齊"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>周冣<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「冣」作「最」。○　札記今本「冣」作「最」。丕烈案：「冣」字是，見前。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>善齊，翟強善楚。二子者，欲傷張儀於魏。張子聞之，因使其人<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本儀之人。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>為見者嗇夫<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本見者，冣與強見王也。正曰：見，賢遍反。見者，謂引見傳命之臣。儀使其臣為見者之嗇夫，以間伺之。補曰：嗇夫，書註，「主幣之官」。秦制，鄉有嗇夫，職獄訟，收賦稅。漢有虎圈嗇夫。所職不同，皆小臣之名。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>聞<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「聞」作「間」。○　間以候伺之。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>見者，因無敢傷張子。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本此九年，儀再相魏時。正曰：無考。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="周冣入齊"><span id=".E5.91.A8.E5.86.A3.E5.85.A5.E9.BD.8A"></span>周冣入齊</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=21" title="编辑章节：周冣入齊"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>周冣入齊，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本魏不善之。正曰：周策，為最謂魏王曰，「王不去周最，合與收齊」；又謂最曰，「魏貴合秦伐齊，而公修虛信」云云，「不如謂王曰，請入齊」。此語在田文相魏昭王時，是最先見逐於齊，今復自魏入齊。詳周策所載，必最後欲之齊，而魏聽之，非不善之故也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本武。正曰：昭。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>怒，令姚賈讓魏王。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本最蓋秦所置以相魏者。正曰：此因下文「為王通天下」一語生說，無據。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>魏王為之<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本為最。蓋秦亦怒最之去魏。正曰：是時齊、秦交惡，而秦欲合魏。最自齊走魏，人言其不忍背齊，而今復之齊，必復為齊所厚者。魏雖欲合秦，而猶牽於收齊之說。其入齊，蓋魏聽之，故為之言於秦，其辭亦婉。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>謂秦王曰：「魏之所以為王通天下者，以周冣也。今周冣遁寡人入齊，齊無通<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一本添「端」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>於天下矣。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本齊、秦為敵，魏既以最通天下於秦，則外齊矣。今最入齊，天下不知，以謂魏使之齊，敗齊事，因不通齊矣。正曰：齊、秦為敵，齊逐最而魏收之，天下信魏之不與齊，故曰為王通天下。今最遁入齊，則天下知魏絕最，而齊收之，齊何以通於天下乎？<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>敝邑之事王，亦無齊累矣。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本齊納魏所不善，則可以絕之。正曰：最遁魏入齊，而齊收之，則齊、魏之絕明矣。秦可以不疑魏之與齊也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>大國欲急兵，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本伐齊。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>則趣趙而已。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本促使應秦也。魏不善最，而言為最，所以自為也。按此姚賈與始皇所問之人，相去八十餘年。高誘欲以為陳賈，若此人者可也。蓋陳，舜後，得為姚姓。而孟子與秦武、魏哀時猶相及，獨以最，韓非相毀之人，為此人，則年時相絕太遠矣，可乎哉？補曰：趣趙，說見周策。正曰：姚賈，說見秦策。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="秦魏為與國"><span id=".E7.A7.A6.E9.AD.8F.E7.82.BA.E8.88.87.E5.9C.8B"></span>秦魏為與國</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=22" title="编辑章节：秦魏為與國"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>秦、魏為與國。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本相與同禍福之國也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>齊、楚約而欲攻魏，魏使人求救於秦，冠蓋相望，秦救不出。
</p><p>魏人有唐且<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「且」作「雎」。○　下同。補曰：新序同。史作「雎」。　札記丕烈案：「且」、「雎」字同。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>者，年九十餘，謂魏王曰：「老臣請出西說秦，令兵先臣出可乎？」魏王曰：「敬諾。」遂約車而遣之。唐且見秦王，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本昭。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦王曰：「丈人芒然乃遠至此，甚苦矣。魏來求救數矣，寡人知魏之急矣。」唐且對曰：「大王已知魏之急而救不至者，是大王籌筴之臣無任矣。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本任，能也。　鮑本不堪其事。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>且夫魏一萬乘之國，稱東藩，受冠帶，祠春秋者，以為秦之強足以為與也。今齊、楚之兵已在魏郊矣，大王之救不至，魏急則且割地而約齊、楚，王雖欲救之，豈有及哉？是亡一萬乘之魏，而強二敵之齊、楚<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>札記今本「楚」誤「強」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>也。竊以為大王籌筴之臣無任矣。」
</p><p>秦王喟然愁悟，遽<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一作「遂」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>發兵，日夜赴魏。齊、楚聞之，乃引兵而去。魏氏復全，唐且之說也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本記十年有。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="信陵君殺晉鄙"><span id=".E4.BF.A1.E9.99.B5.E5.90.9B.E6.AE.BA.E6.99.89.E9.84.99"></span>信陵君殺晉鄙</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=23" title="编辑章节：信陵君殺晉鄙"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>信陵君殺晉鄙，救邯鄲，破秦人，存趙國，趙王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本孝成。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>自郊迎。唐且<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「且」作「雎」。○　正曰：史不云唐且，恐有訛舛。說又見後章。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>謂信陵君曰：「臣聞之曰，事有不可知者，有不可不知者；有不可忘者，有不可不忘者。」信陵君曰：「何謂也？」對曰：「人之憎我也，不可不知也；吾憎人也，不可得而知也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本人不能知。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>人之有德於我也，不可忘也；吾有德於人也，不可不忘也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：史云，「物有不可忘，或有不可不忘。夫人有德於公子，不可忘也；公子有德於人，願公子忘之也」。語尤簡潔。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>今君殺晉鄙，救邯鄲，破秦人，存趙國，此大德也。今趙王自郊迎，卒<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「卒」，「猝」同。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>然見趙王，臣願君之忘之也。」信陵君曰：「無忌謹受教。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本彪謂：唐雎比十一年求救，年已九十餘，至是又十年，其陳誼益高，所謂耄期稱道不亂者歟？賢矣！<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="魏攻管而不下"><span id=".E9.AD.8F.E6.94.BB.E7.AE.A1.E8.80.8C.E4.B8.8D.E4.B8.8B"></span>魏攻管而不下</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=24" title="编辑章节：魏攻管而不下"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>魏攻管<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：管見前策。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>而不下。安陵<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本魏記註，召陵有安陵。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>人縮高，其子為管守。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：秦攻韓管而得之。縮高之子為秦守者也。通鑑綱目，縮高之子仕於秦。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>信陵君使人謂安陵君曰：「君<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一本無「君」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>其遣縮高，吾將仕之以五大夫，使為持節尉。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本尉之持節者。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>安陵君曰：「安陵，小國也，不能必使其民。使者自往，請使道使<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一本添「吏」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>者<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本使人道之。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>至縞<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「縞」作「縮」。○　札記今本「縞」作「縮」。丕烈案：「縮」字是也。古今人表中上有「縮高」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>高之所，復信陵君之命。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本復，猶重也。信陵君言之矣，今申之。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>縮高曰：「君之幸高也，將使高攻管也。夫以<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一本無「以」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>父攻子守，人大笑也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本守人，其子之人。正曰：「守」字句。補曰：一本標一作「人之所大笑」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>是臣而下，是倍主<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「是」作「見」，「倍」作「背」，「主」作「王」。○　王，魏王。正曰：秦王。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>也。父教子倍，亦非君之所喜也。敢再拜辭。」
</p><p>使者以報信陵君，信陵君大怒，遣大使之安陵曰：「安陵之地，亦猶魏也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本正曰：說見下。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>今吾攻管而不下，則秦兵及我，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本管在秦東，可以捍魏。正曰：不得秦地，必受秦攻。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>社稷必危矣。願君之生束縮高而致之。若君弗致也，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本無「也」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>無忌將發十萬之師，以造<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「造」作「告」。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>安陵之城。」安陵君曰：「吾先君成侯，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本趙主也。安陵屬召陵，召陵屬魏。而此謂成侯為先君，蓋先時兩屬趙、魏，故上曰「猶魏」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>受詔襄王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本趙襄子。補曰：大事記引作「襄主」。見上。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>以守此地也，手受大府之憲。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本大府，謂魏受詔襄子而受魏之憲，則此兩屬明矣。憲，法令也。正曰：大府之憲，即受詔於襄子者。上篇，猶言第一篇也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>憲之上篇曰：『子弒父，臣弒君，有常<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「常」下補「刑」字。○　正曰：有常，即常刑也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>不赦。國雖大赦，降城亡子<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本以城降人，及亡人之子。正曰：亡人。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>不得與焉。』今縮高謹解<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「解」作「雖辭」二字。○　補曰：一本無「謹」字。姚本「謹解」。則「雖」乃「謹」之訛。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>大位，以全父子之義，而君曰『必生致之』，是使我負襄王詔<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「詔」上有「之」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>而廢大府之憲也，雖死終不敢行。」
</p><p>縮高聞之曰：「信陵君為人，悍而自用也。此辭反，必為國禍。吾已全己，無<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一本作「己之」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>為<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「為」作「違」。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>人臣之義矣，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本正曰：無違人臣者，不事二君之義。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>豈可使吾君有魏患也。」乃之使者之舍，刎頸而死。
</p><p>信陵君聞縮高死，素<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本衍「素」字。補曰：字衍。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>服縞素辟舍，使使者謝安陵君曰：「無忌，小人也，困<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本困，猶不通。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>於思慮，失言於君，敢再拜釋罪。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本拜，所以謝也。以安陵釋其罪，故謝。彪謂：縮高之義直，而善處死。夫以信陵之愎而好遂，高不死，必加兵安陵，城破之日，固不免死，而以此死易一國之命，可不謂仁乎？正曰：信陵君賢而服義，使其再聞安陵之辭，亦將翻然而悔矣。師不以直，逞欲殘民，決不為也。縮高不忍須臾之死，而成其過，惜哉！補曰，按上章無忌書，謂王之使者譖安陵於秦，而此策云云，未詳。「管守」、「子守」之「守」，「使者」、「大使」之「使」，皆去聲。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="魏王與龍陽君共船而釣"><span id=".E9.AD.8F.E7.8E.8B.E8.88.87.E9.BE.8D.E9.99.BD.E5.90.9B.E5.85.B1.E8.88.B9.E8.80.8C.E9.87.A3"></span>魏王與龍陽君共船而釣</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=25" title="编辑章节：魏王與龍陽君共船而釣"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>魏王與龍陽君<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本魏之幸臣。正曰：幸姬也。策言美人，又云拂枕席，此非楚安陵君、鄢陵君、壽陵君、趙建信君之比。長孫佐輔于武陵等詩用「前魚」字，皆以宮人言之。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>共船而釣，龍陽君得十餘魚而涕下。王曰：「有所不安乎？如是，何不相告也？」對曰：「臣無敢不安也。」王曰：「然則何為涕出？」曰：「臣為王之所得魚也。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「王」作「臣」。○　正曰：以己之得魚，推言王。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>王曰：「何謂也？」對曰：「臣之始得魚也，臣甚喜，後得又益大，今臣直欲棄臣前之所得矣。今以臣凶惡，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「臣」下有「之」字。○　補曰：一本「今以臣凶惡」。按孟子「惡人」註，謂醜貌人。此疑衍「凶」字，或「之」字訛。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>而得為王拂枕席。今臣爵至人君，走人於庭，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本在庭則人為之趨走。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>辟人於途。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「辟」作「避」。○　在途則行者避。補曰：「避」，一本作「辟」，宜音闢。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>四海之內，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一本添「其」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>美人亦甚多矣，聞臣之得幸於王也，必褰<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本褰，揭也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>裳而趨王。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「王」上有「大」字。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>臣亦猶曩臣之前所得魚也，臣亦將棄矣，臣安能無涕出乎？」魏王曰：「誤！<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本以不告為誤。正曰：誤，猶言誤矣，當句。然恐是「譆」字訛。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>有是心也，何不相告也？」於是布令於四境之內曰：「有敢言美人者族。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本死及其族。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p><p>由是觀之，近習之人，其摯<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本摯，猶進。正曰：摯，說文，握持也。又字同「摯」、「質」，義亦可同。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>諂也固矣，其自纂繁<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「纂」作「羃」，「繁」作「繫」。○　補曰：恐當作「繫」。　札記今本「纂」作「羃」，「繁」作「繫」，乃誤涉鮑也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>也完矣。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本謂帽覆也。　鮑本羃，覆也。言自芘自結於王。正曰：高註「帽覆」，似亦作「羃」義。按，纂，組類，固結之義。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>今由千里之外，欲進美人，所效者庸必得幸乎？假之得幸，庸必為我用乎？<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本我，謂欲進之人。正曰：為我用，猶言如我寵，上句言未必得幸，此句言假使得幸，未必如我也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>而近習之人相與怨，我見有禍，未見有福；見有怨，未見有德，非用知之術也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本正曰：此策不知何王，未可以安釐、哀、襄之世，遂附之也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="秦攻魏急"><span id=".E7.A7.A6.E6.94.BB.E9.AD.8F.E6.80.A5"></span>秦攻魏急</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=26" title="编辑章节：秦攻魏急"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>秦攻魏急。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本始皇五年攻魏，取二十城。此元年。正曰：說見後。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>或謂魏王曰：<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：孔叢子云，「秦急攻魏，魏王恐。或謂子順曰，『如之何』？答曰，『吾私其計，然豈能賢於執政，故無言焉』。魏王聞之，駕如孔氏親問焉，曰，『國亡矣，如之何』？對曰」云云。下文並同。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>「棄之不如用之之易也，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本棄，謂戰而喪地。用，謂割地賂之。正曰：見下。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>死<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本死，謂敗死。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>之不如棄之之易也。能棄之弗能用之，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一本無「之」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>能死之弗能棄之，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本劉無「之」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>此人之大過也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：孔叢子註，言棄其地不如用其地，以攻守為易；死其地不如棄其地，以圖存為易。蓋當計其勢如何爾，在棄之用之得其宜。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>今王亡地數百里，亡城數十，而國患不解，是王棄之，非用之也。今秦之強也，天下無敵，而魏之弱也甚，而王以是質<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「質」作「賓」。○　正曰：孔叢子註云，景閔為太子時，嘗質於秦。　札記丕烈案：「質秦」字，前有。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦，王又能死而弗能棄之，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一本作「也」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>此重過也。今王能用臣之計，虧地不足以傷國，卑體不足以苦身，解患而怨<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本怨，謂不韋主攻者也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>報。
</p><p>「秦自四境之內，執法以下<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本執政之臣。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>至於長輓者，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本長為輓車之人。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>故畢<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本畢，猶盡。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>曰：『與嫪氏<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本嫪毐，秦太后私人。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>乎？與呂氏<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本不韋也。此言與嫪氏耳。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>乎？』雖至於門閭之下，廊廟之上，猶之如是也。今王割地以<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>札記今本「以」誤「王」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>賂秦，以為嫪毐功；<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本因毐而割，故功在毒。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>卑體以尊秦，以因嫪毐。王以國贊嫪毐，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本毐貴矣，今又因之以割，是以魏助之也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>以嫪毐勝<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本以不敗為勝。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>矣。王以國贊嫪氏，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「氏」作「毐」。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>太后之德王也，深於骨髓，王之交最為天下上矣。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：孔叢子註，言太后德王，則秦不加兵，是乃王以此交秦，為天下之上矣。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>秦、魏百相交也，百相欺也。<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本言昔之交，皆卒歸於欺。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>今由嫪氏善秦而交為天下上，天下孰不棄呂氏而從嫪氏？<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本時二人已惡。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>天下必合<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本一作「舍」。　鮑本「合」作「舍」。○　補曰：恐「合」字訛，大事記作「舍」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>呂氏而從嫪氏，則王之怨報矣。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本正曰：大事記以此章附見於始皇八年封嫪毐長信侯之下，謂嫪、呂爭權，略見於此。景閔元年，秦拔二十城，策言亡地數百里，亡城數十，則此在後矣。二年，拔朝歌，三年，拔汲。大事記所書，則拔汲之年。所謂秦攻魏急者，蓋其時矣。補曰：大事記曰，子順進退有聖賢之風，寧忍出此乎？<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="秦王使人謂安陵君"><span id=".E7.A7.A6.E7.8E.8B.E4.BD.BF.E4.BA.BA.E8.AC.82.E5.AE.89.E9.99.B5.E5.90.9B"></span>秦王使人謂安陵君</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%AD%96_(%E5%A3%AB%E7%A6%AE%E5%B1%85%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)/%E9%AD%8F/%E5%9B%9B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=27" title="编辑章节：秦王使人謂安陵君"><span>编辑</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p>秦王<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本始皇。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>使人謂安陵君曰：「寡人欲以五百里之地易安陵，安陵君其許寡人。」安陵君曰：「大王加惠，以大易小，甚善。雖然，受地於先生，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「生」作「王」，下同。○<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>願終守之，弗敢易。」秦王不說。安陵君因使唐且<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「且」作「雎」。○　下同。　札記丕烈案：說苑作「且」。古今人表中中「安陵君唐雎」，即此也。吳氏正曰，唐且之名，見於策者不一，其論是矣，唯引新序「司馬唐且」，誤。此乃司馬唐，衍「且」字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>使於秦。秦王謂唐且曰：「寡人以五百里之地易安陵，安陵君不聽寡人，何也？且秦滅韓<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本十八年。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>亡魏，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本二十二年。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>而君以五十里之地存者，以君為長者，故不錯<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：錯，置也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>意也。今吾以十倍之地，請廣於君，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本廣其地。正曰：設辭易地，實欲得之，當識其意。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>而君逆寡人者，輕寡人與？」唐且對曰：「否，非若是也。安陵君受地於先生而守之，雖千里不敢易也，豈直五百里哉？」秦王怫然怒，謂唐且曰：「公亦嘗聞天子之怒乎？」唐且對曰：「臣未嘗聞也。」秦王曰：「天子之怒，伏屍百萬，流血千里。」唐且曰：「大王嘗聞布衣之怒乎？」秦王曰：「布衣之怒，亦免冠徒跣，以頭搶地爾。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本「爾」作「耳」。○　搶，突也。補曰：太史公語本此。說苑作「顙地」。師古曰，搶，千羊反。　札記丕烈案：今說苑作「頓地耳」，「頓」疑訛字。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>唐且曰：「此庸夫之怒也，非士之怒也。夫專諸之刺王僚<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本僚，吳王。昭二十七年。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>也，彗星襲月；聶政之刺韓傀<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本傀，韓相，見韓策及刺客傳。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>也，白虹貫日；要離之刺慶忌也，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本吳越春秋，「要離，吳人。吳王闔閭欲殺王子慶忌，要離詐以罪亡，令吳王焚其妻子，走見慶忌，以劍刺之」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>倉<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本補曰：倉，即蒼。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>鷹擊於殿上。此三子者，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本無「者」字。○　札記丕烈案：說苑無。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>皆布衣之士也，懷怒未發，休祲<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本休，吉徵。祲，戾氣。自三子言之為吉。正曰：說文，祲，精氣感祥也。此「休」字，猶言祥。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>降於天，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>姚本曾、劉作「休烈隆於天」。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>與臣而將四矣。若士必怒，伏屍二人，流血五步，天下縞素，今日是也。」挺劍而起。秦王色撓，<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本撓，擾也。正曰：撓，屈也，奴效反。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>長跪而謝之曰：「先生坐，何至於此，寡人諭<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本諭，曉也。<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>矣。夫韓、魏滅亡，而安陵以五十里之地存者，徒以有先生也。」<small style="color:var(--color-destructive--visited,#996666)"><span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〈</span>鮑本雎自釐十一年請救，至是五十餘年矣。彪謂：諸刺劫之士，自曹沫以至荊軻，皆不聞道，惟若唐雎者可也。為其激而發，不專志於此也。正曰：唐且之名，見於策者不一。秦策，應侯遣唐且載金之武安，散天下士。魏安釐王十一年，唐且說秦，是時應侯始相，雎老於魏，不應復為秦用，又一唐且也。且為魏說秦時，九十餘，至與信陵君語，相去十年，已百歲。為安陵君使秦，有滅韓亡魏之言，魏亡在始皇二十二年，上去說秦凡四十二年，決不存矣，又一唐且也。楚策，唐且見春申君，又一唐且也。新序，秦攻魏，司馬唐且諫曰段干木云云，當文侯時，又一唐且也。愚謂，此策文甚明，而事多難言。以始皇之兵威，何憚於安陵而易以五百里地？是特為之辭而使之納地耳！唐且之使愚矣。雖抗言不屈，豈終能沮之乎？荊軻之見也，匿匕首於圖。秦法，侍者不得操兵，此云「挺劍而起」，何也？其辭固多誇矣！<span style="color:transparent;font-size:0px">〉</span></small>
</p>
<ol class="references">
<li id="cite&#95;note-1"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><a href="#cite_ref-1">↑</a></span> <span class="reference-text">［校一］此篇姚本與《芮宋欲絕秦趙之交》連篇，鮑本另列一篇。據文義，從鮑本。</span>
</li>
</ol>
